# Copy to .env and fill in locally. Never commit .env. No value below is real.
# Names are declared here only where an architectural need already exists
# (docs/DECISIONS.md, docs/ACCOUNT_READINESS.md).

# --- The Graph (Sprint 1, verified live on 5 September 2026) ---
# Subgraph Studio API key. Sent only as an `Authorization: Bearer` header,
# never in a URL, and redacted from every output. Required by
# `corepack pnpm --filter @cas/graph-evidence probe:live` and `test:live`.
GRAPH_API_KEY=
# Optional. Gateway base URL; the default is the public gateway. Not a secret.
# GRAPH_GATEWAY_URL=https://gateway.thegraph.com/api

# --- Postgres (D8: local development only; live deployment target unresolved) ---
# Standard libpq-style connection URL consumed by the database package from Sprint 2.
DATABASE_URL=

# --- Anthropic (D9: classification and drafting model; exact model unresolved) ---
# Read by the official Anthropic SDK.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# --- Configuration categories without a verified variable name yet ---
# The variable names for the categories below are NOT fixed. Each will be set
# in the sprint that introduces the integration, against that provider's
# current documentation. Do not invent names for them before then.
#
# Graph Market access only if an optional product path, such as Substreams,
#   actually requires it (D11). Not needed for the standardized-schema route.
# Editorial week boundary (D10): start, freeze and publication timestamps;
#   timezone provisionally America/Toronto.
# Hedera testnet operator credentials (Sprint 8, conditional on the 10 September Graph gate).
# x402 facilitator configuration, referred to as Blocky402 in the plan (Sprint 8, conditional).
# Bazantic API credentials (Sprint 8, conditional).
